<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Sept producer prices up 0.6 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Sept producer prices up 0.6 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIA PRODUCER PRICES	Sept    Aug    Sept 95</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)	    +0.6    +0.3     +1.1</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (pct)		+6.8    +7.3    +10.9</p>
<p>--Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
